{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mal-3-1","title":"Malachi 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Of the messenger, majesty, and grace of Christ. 7 Of the rebellion, 8 sacrilege, 13 and infidelity of the people. 16 The promise of blessing to them that fear God.</p>\n<p>I will. 2:7; 4:5; Mt 11:10,11; Mr 1:2,3; Lu 1:76; 7:26-28; Joh 1:6,7 and he. Isa 40:3-5; Mt 3:1-3; 17:10-13; Lu 1:16,17; 3:3-6 Joh 1:15-23,33,34; 3:28-30; Ac 13:24,25; 19:4 and. Ps 110:1; Isa 7:14; 9:6; Hag 2:7-9; Lu 2:11,21-32,38,46 Lu 7:19,20; 19:47; Joh 2:14-16 even. Ge 48:15,16; Ex 23:20; Isa 63:9; Ho 12:3-5; Ac 7:38 he shall come. Hag 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-2","title":"Malachi 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>who may abide. 4:1; Am 5:18-20; Mt 3:7-12; 21:31-44; 23:13-35; 25:10; Lu 2:34 Lu 3:9,17; 7:23; 11:37-47,52-54; 21:36 Joh 6:42-44; 8:41-48,55; 9:39-41; 15:22-24; Ac 7:52-54; Ro 9:31-33 Ro 11:5-10; Heb 10:28,29; 12:25; 1Pe 2:7,8; Re 1:6,7; 6:17 for. Isa 4:4; Zec 13:9; Mt 3:10-12; 1Co 3:13-15; Re 2:23 like fullers'. Ps 2:7; Isa 1:18; Jer 2:22; Mr 9:3; Re 1:5; 7:14; 19:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-3","title":"Malachi 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>sit. Ps 66:10; Pr 17:3; 25:4; Isa 1:25; 48:10; Jer 6:28-30; Eze 22:18-22 Da 12:10; Zec 13:9; Lu 3:16; Eph 5:26,27; Tit 2:14; Heb 12:10 1Pe 1:7; 4:12,13; Re 3:18 the sons. 1:6-10; 2:1-8; Isa 61:6; 66:19-21; Jer 33:18-22; Eze 44:15,16 Re 1:6; 5:10 an. 1:11; Ps 4:5; 50:14,23; 69:30,31; 107:21,22; 116:17; 141:1,2; Ho 14:2 Joh 4:23,24; Ro 12:1; 15:16; Php 2:17; 4:18; 2Ti 4:6; Heb 13:15,16 1Pe 2:5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-4","title":"Malachi 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseE