R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>a man. Ps 29:2; Pr 3:9,10; Mt 22:21; Mr 12:17; Lu 20:25; Ro 13:7 In. 1:8,13; Le 5:15,16; 27:2-34; Nu 18:21-32; Jos 7:11; Ne 13:4-14 Ro 2:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-9","title":"Malachi 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>2:2; De 28:15-19; Jos 7:12,13; 22:20; Isa 43:28; Hag 1:6-11; 2:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-10","title":"Malachi 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>all. 2Ch 31:4-10; Ne 10:33-39; Pr 3:9,10 the storehouse. 1Ch 26:20; 2Ch 31:11-19; Ne 10:38; 12:44,47; 13:5,10-13 and prove. 1Ki 17:13-16; Ps 37:3; Hag 2:19; Mt 6:33; 2Co 9:6-8 open. Ge 7:11; De 28:12; 2Ki 7:2,19 pour you out. Heb. empty out. Ec 11:3 that there. Le 26:10; 2Ch 31:10; Lu 5:6,7; 12:16,17; Joh 21:6-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-11","title":"Malachi 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>rebuke. Joe 2:20; Am 4:9; 7:1-3; Hag 2:17 destroy. Heb. corrupt. neither. De 11:14; Jer 8:13; Joe 1:7,12; 2:22; Hab 3:17; Zec 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-12","title":"Malachi 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>all. De 4:6,7; 2Ch 32:23; Ps 72:17; Isa 61:9; Jer 33:9; Zep 3:19,20 Zec 8:23; Lu 1:48 a delightsome. De 8:7-10; 11:12; Da 8:9; 11:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-13","title":"Malachi 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Your. 2:17; Ex 5:2; 2Ch 32:14-19; Job 34:7,8; Ps 10:11; Isa 5:19; 28:14,15 Isa 37:23; 2Th 2:4 What. 8; 1:6-8; 2:14,17; Job 40:8; Jer 8:12; Ro 9:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-14","title":"Malachi 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>It is. Job 21:14,15; 22:17; 34:9; 35:3; Ps 73:8-13; Isa 58:3; Zep 1:12 ordinance. Heb. observation. and that. Isa 58:3; Joe 2:12; Zec 7:3-6; Jas 4:9 mournfully. Heb. in black.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-15","title":"Malachi 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>we call. 4:1; Es 5:10; Ps 10:3; 49:18; 73:12; Da 4:30,37; 5:20-28; Ac 12:21 1Pe 5:5 yea. 2:17; Job 12:6; 21:7-15,30; Pr 12:12; Ec 9:1,2; Jer 12:1,2 Hab 1:13-17 set. Heb. built. Job 22:23 they that tempt. Nu 14:22,23; Da 6:16; Ps 78:18,41,56; 95:9; 106:14; Mt 4:6,7; Ac 5:9 1Co 10:9; Heb 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-16","title":"Malachi 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>that feared. 5; 4:2; Ge 22:12; 1Ki 18:3,12; Job 28:28; Ps 33:18; 111:10; 112:1 Ps 147:11; Isa 50:10; Ac 9:31; 10:2; Re 15:4 spake. De 6:6-8; 1Sa 23:16-18; Es 4:5-17; Ps 16:3; 66:16; 73:15-17; 119:63 Pr 13:20; Eze 9:4; Da 2:17,18; Lu 2:38; 24:14-31; Joh 1:40-47 Joh 12:20-22; Ac 1:13; 2:1; 4:23-30; Eph 5:19; 1Th 5:11,14; Heb 3:13 Heb 10:24; 12:15 and the. 2Sa 7:1; 2Ch 6:7; Ps 139:4; Mt 18:19,20; Ac 4:31-33 a book. Es 2:23; 6:1; Job 19:23-25; Ps 56:8; Isa 65:6; Da 7:10; Mt 12:35-37 Re 20:12 that thought. Ps 10:4; 20:7; 94:19; 104:33; Isa 26:3,8; Heb 4:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mal-3-17","title":"Malachi 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAL","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>they shall. So 2:16; Jer 31:33; 32:38,39; Eze 16:8; 36:27,28; Zec 13:9 Joh 10:27-30; 17:9,10,24; 1Co 3:22,23; 6:20; 15:23; Ga 5:24 2Th 1:7-10; Re 20:12-15 jewels. or, special treasure. Ex 19:5; De 7:6; 14:2; 26:17,18; Ps 135:4; Isa 62:3,4; Tit